# Fallback reasoning words for when no local chat model is installed — copy to .tools/reason-words.txt
# (gitignored, so your language's words never ship in the template).
#
# When the local orchestrator model IS installed, routing uses self-consistency voting instead and
# this list is only a backstop. One Python regex fragment per line; joined as a case-insensitive
# alternation, each anchored at a word boundary. Use stems (no trailing boundary) to match endings.
# Lines starting with # are ignored. Built-in default is English-only; add your language here.
#
# English (already the default):
why
how
compare
contrast
deriv
prove
explain
differ
relat
evaluat
reason
# Add your language, e.g. Polish:
# dlaczego
# porówn
# wyjaśn
# różnic
# po\s+co
# w\s+jaki\s+sposób
